'''Dragon''' items are the highest tier of item material. [[Blades:Divine|Divine]] items, while different in appearance to the generic Dragon items, are still considered to be Dragon and involve the same [[Blades:Materials|materials]] when [[Blades:Tempering|tempering]] and [[Blades:Salvaging|salvaging]].

