'''Dragonbone''' [[Blades:Weapons|weapons]] are characterized by their use of [[Blades:Dragon Bones|dragon bones]], [[Blades:Ebony Ingot|ebony ingots]], and [[Blades:Malachite Ingot|malachite ingots]]. The following generic Dragonbone weapons can be [[Blades:Crafting|crafted]] at [[Blades:Smithy|Smithy]] level 10.
