==Dragonscale==
'''Dragonscale''' [[Blades:Items|items]] are characterized by their use of [[Blades:Dragon Scales|dragon scales]], [[Blades:Stalhrim (item)|stalhrim]], and [[Blades:Malachite Ingot|malachite ingots]]. The following generic Dragonscale items grant [[Blades:Resist Cleaving|Resist Cleaving]] or [[Blades:Block Bonus Vs Cleaving|Block Bonus Vs Cleaving]] and [[Blades:Resist Poison|Resist Poison]] or [[Blades:Block Bonus Vs Poison|Block Bonus Vs Poison]]. They can be [[Blades:Crafting|crafted]] at [[Blades:Smithy|Smithy]] level 10.
